| 7 | 1,2,3,4,5,6,8,9,10 | 9 |
| 8 | 1,3,5,7,9 | 5 |
| 9 | 1,2,4,5,7,8,10 | 7 |
| 10 | 1,3,7,9 | 4 |

**Total:** $10 + 5 + 7 + 5 + 8 + 3 + 9 + 5 + 7 + 4 = \boxed{63}$

